  "notes": "Cash-basis county, governmental funds only. Statement lines from Exhibit D Total Governmental Total column (p4): fund balance 6,147,808 + 4,719,252 - 4,354,082 + 125,075 - 125,075 = 6,512,978. Beginning cash is not printed (only beginning fund balance), so beginning_cash is null; ending cash 5,476,043 and designated investments 1,036,935 from Exhibit C (p3). Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet - Cash Basis (Exhibit C Total), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Capital Outlay 22,153 (Courthouse Building capital project fund) prints no function, labelled 'Capital Outlay'. Detail: General, Road and Inheritance Tax budget schedules (pp5-8) and the nonmajor combining schedules per fund column (pp9-11); the Schedule 5 nonmajor budget schedules (pp12-14) print only fund totals and are not recorded (Emergency 911 budget-basis disbursements 1,075 = its transfer out). General Fund 'Taxes' 1,719,246 split into Property Taxes 1,581,017 + Motor Vehicle Tax 138,229 from the Exhibit D General column. Budget lines with a blank actual (Diversion Program, Institutions, Inheritance Tax General Government) are not recorded; Inheritance Tax fund disbursements total 0. Drug Law Enforcement fund had no activity. No budget schedule for the Courthouse Building capital project fund is in the trim, so its Exhibit D column (receipts 10,715, capital outlay 22,153) is not in detail. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
}
